{"id":"429dd2b96f81efcc","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat Presheaf Category","display":"df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category — ZFC Cat Presheaf Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category — ZFC Cat Presheaf Category","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category — ZFC Cat Presheaf Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category\">../batch04/58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7\" href=\"?note=00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md\">58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7200e183a0335a63\" href=\"?note=7200e183a0335a63\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76fcf4f967d128d9\" href=\"?note=76fcf4f967d128d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md\">58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V\">\\(U\\in V\\)</span> (Grothendieck-universe parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small category), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^{op}\">\\(\\mathcal C^{op}\\)</span> (its opposite), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U\\)</span> (presheaf-category candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_U\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_U\\)</span> (the set-coded category of members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> and functions between them)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Mor}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Mor}\\)</span> (category structure operators)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category\">../batch04/58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S\\)</span> (opposite-category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7\" href=\"?note=00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category\">58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S\\)</span> (functor-category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7200e183a0335a63\" href=\"?note=7200e183a0335a63\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S\\)</span> (Grothendieck-universe predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"76fcf4f967d128d9\" href=\"?note=76fcf4f967d128d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md\">58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (presheaf-category predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}presheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\in U\n\\land\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in U\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathbf{Set}_U,M_U,s_U,t_U,\\circ_U,e_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathbf{Set}_U=\\langle U,M_U,s_U,t_U,\\circ_U,e_U\\rangle\n\\land M_U=\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle:A,B\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\}\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\in M_U\\;\\bigl(\ns_U(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)=A\\land t_U(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)=B\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\bigl(e_U(A)=\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\forall A,B,D\\in U\\;\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,D)\n\\to\\langle B,D,g\\rangle\\circ_U\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\n=\\langle A,D,g\\circ f\\rangle\\Bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{Set}_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathbf{Set}_U)\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}presheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\in U\n\\land\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in U\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathbf{Set}_U,M_U,s_U,t_U,\\circ_U,e_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathbf{Set}_U=\\langle U,M_U,s_U,t_U,\\circ_U,e_U\\rangle\n\\land M_U=\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle:A,B\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\}\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\in M_U\\;\\bigl(\ns_U(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)=A\\land t_U(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)=B\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\bigl(e_U(A)=\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\forall A,B,D\\in U\\;\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,D)\n\\to\\langle B,D,g\\rangle\\circ_U\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\n=\\langle A,D,g\\circ f\\rangle\\Bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{Set}_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathbf{Set}_U)\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The category of all sets is a proper class and cannot be passed to the set-coded category predicate. The explicit universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> supplies the honest set category <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_U\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_U\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Requiring both object and morphism carriers of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> to belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> small relative to the same size convention used for presheaf values.</li>\n<li>The object-carrier projection uses the declared upstream symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span> consistently.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category","status":"resolved","id":"7200e183a0335a63","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"76fcf4f967d128d9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category","status":"resolved","id":"00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S$ (opposite-category predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category","status":"resolved","id":"7200e183a0335a63","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S$ (functor-category predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat2-functor-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"76fcf4f967d128d9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S$ (Grothendieck-universe predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C^{op}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Mor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}presheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\in U\n\\land\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in U\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathbf{Set}_U,M_U,s_U,t_U,\\circ_U,e_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathbf{Set}_U=\\langle U,M_U,s_U,t_U,\\circ_U,e_U\\rangle\n\\land M_U=\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle:A,B\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\}\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\in M_U\\;\\bigl(\ns_U(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)=A\\land t_U(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)=B\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\bigl(e_U(A)=\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\forall A,B,D\\in U\\;\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,D)\n\\to\\langle B,D,g\\rangle\\circ_U\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\n=\\langle A,D,g\\circ f\\rangle\\Bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{Set}_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FunctorCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathbf{Set}_U)\n\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}","display":false}],"bytes":3164,"backlinks":[{"id":"78c3be29a4eab0f7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1566","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category.md|58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7","7200e183a0335a63","76fcf4f967d128d9","36d7463d215be751","e637becf421e4e61"]}